### build: 端口池状态
GET {{base_url}}/api/build/port-pool-status

### build: 列出 dev server
GET {{base_url}}/api/build/list-dev

### build: 启动 dev server
POST {{base_url}}/api/build/start-dev
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": "{{test_project}}"}

### build: keep-alive
POST {{base_url}}/api/build/keep-alive
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": "{{test_project}}", "pid": 0}

### build: 停止 dev server
POST {{base_url}}/api/build/stop-dev
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": "{{test_project}}", "pid": 0}

### build: 解析构建错误
POST {{base_url}}/api/build/parse-build-error
Content-Type: application/json

{"error": "Module not found: Can't resolve './missing'"}
